OL,4,CMotorcycle rider takes cricket       W5
OL,5,                                      W5
OL,6,G"I told my friend riding the         W5
OL,7,Gmotorcycle to duck his head. I'm     W5
OL,8,Ggoing to catch it."                  W5
OL,9,                                      W5
OL,10,GThese are the words of Mehran Khan,  W5
OL,11,Gwho amazed sports fans around the    W5
OL,12,Gworld when he caught a cricket ball  W5
OL,13,Gwhile sitting on the back of a       W5
OL,14,Gmoving motorcycle.                   W5
OL,15,                                      W5
OL,16,GMehran was passing a match in the    W5
OL,17,GSwat Premier League in Mingora when  W5
OL,18,Ga ball sailed out of the ground      W5
OL,19,Gtowards him, with the passenger      W5
OL,20,Greaching out to catch it one-handed. W5
